    "id": 47639740,
    "slug": "tnb3rv",
    "title": "tinymce",
    "description": "npm i tinymce简单粗暴的方式：下载文件 放到public中📎tinymce_5.8.1.zip 并在index.html中引用 tinymce.min.js 中文化需要下载 📎zh_CN.js写成组件        ",
    "cover": null,
    "body": "npm i tinymce\n\n简单粗暴的方式：\n\n1.  下载文件 放到public中[📎tinymce\\_5.8.1.zip](https://www.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2021/zip/200222/1624419753892-257d1db6-9f0c-4e9f-850e-4676d4f5303b.zip) 并在index.html中引用 tinymce.min.js\n\n中文化需要下载 [📎zh\\_CN.js](https://www.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2021/js/200222/1624420342999-f6ee3ad3-7d69-4ac5-9801-feb85ebc221f.js)\n\n2.  写成组件\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <textarea :id=\"id\" :value=\"value\"></textarea>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nimport { mapActions, mapGetters } from 'vuex'\nimport 'xx/zh\\_CN.js' // 引入中文\n\nconst INIT = 0\nexport default {\n  name: 'TinymceEditor',\n  props: {\n    value: {\n      type: String,\n      required: true\n    },\n    setting: {}\n  },\n  data() {\n    return {\n      status: INIT,\n      id: 'editor-' + new Date().getMilliseconds(),\n      EDITOR: null\n    }\n  },\n  computed: {\n    ...mapGetters({\n      uploadImg: 'uploadImg', // 自定义图片上传\n    })\n  },\n  mounted() {\n    const setting = {\n      selector: '#' + this.id,\n      menubar: false,\n      language: 'zh\\_CN',\n      toolbar:\n        'formatselect bold italic underline strikethrough | fontselect fontsizeselect forecolor backcolor | alignleft aligncenter alignright alignjustify | bullist numlist | image table | link unlink | indent outdent | superscript subscript | removeformat |  wordcount charmap | undo redo | fullscreen | ',\n      plugins: \\[\n        'link',\n        'image',\n        'imagetools',\n        'table',\n        'lists',\n        'fullscreen',\n        'quickbars',\n        'charmap',\n        'autolink',\n        'wordcount'\n      \\],\n      fontsize\\_formats: '12px 14px 16px 18px 24px 36px 48px 56px 72px',\n      font\\_formats:\n        '微软雅黑=Microsoft YaHei,Helvetica Neue,PingFang SC,sans-serif;苹果苹方=PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif;宋体=simsun,serif;仿宋体=FangSong,serif;黑体=SimHei,sans-serif;Arial=arial,helvetica,sans-serif;Arial Black=arial black,avant garde;Book Antiqua=book antiqua,palatino;', //字体样式\n\n      height: '500px',\n      a11y\\_advanced\\_options: true,\n      branding: false, //隐藏右下角技术支持\n      paste\\_retain\\_style\\_properties: 'all',\n      paste\\_data\\_images: true,\n      image\\_advtab: true, //为图像属性编辑窗口添加高级属性，可以自定义图片的css样式（内置style）、边距（margin）和边框（border）。\n      image\\_description: false, //显示隐藏图片说明input\n      images\\_upload\\_handler: this.imgUpload,\n      imagetools\\_cors\\_hosts: \\[\n        'testimg.zuoyebang.cc',\n        'img.zuoyebang.cc',\n        'wiki.zuoyebang.cc'\n      \\],\n      init\\_instance\\_callback: this.myCustomInitInstance,\n      quickbars\\_insert\\_toolbar: false,\n      quickbars\\_selection\\_toolbar: false,\n      placeholder: '请输入正文'\n    }\n    Object.assign(setting, this.setting)\n    tinymce.init(setting)\n  },\n  beforeDestroy: function () {\n    tinymce.get(this.id).destroy()\n  },\n  methods: {\n    ...mapActions({\n      uploading: 'uploadImgAction'\n    }),\n    myCustomInitInstance(editor) {\n      this.EDITOR = editor\n      editor.setContent(this.value)\n      editor.on('change input', () => {\n        var content = editor.getContent()\n        this.$route.query.docId\n          ? this.$emit('input', content)\n          : this.$emit('change', content)\n      })\n    },\n    async imgUpload(blobInfo, success, failure) {\n      //文件上传的formData传递\n      let formData = new FormData()\n      formData.append('file', blobInfo.blob(), blobInfo.filename())\n      await this.uploading(formData)\n      this.uploadImg.picUrl\n        ? success(this.uploadImg.picUrl)\n        : failure('上传失败')\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n\n3.父组件\n\n<el-form-item prop=\"content\">\n\t\t<tiny-editor-page\n\t\t\t\tclass=\"editor\"\n        :value=\"form.content\"\n        @change=\"contentUe\"\n    ></tiny-editor-page>\n</el-form-item>\n\n<script>\n  \n...\n\nmethods:{\n\t\tcontentUe(value) {\n      this.form.content = value //富文本中的内容\n    },\n}\n...\n</script>",
    "created_at": "2021-06-23T03:39:19.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-06T08:27:36.000Z"
